 35S  c  1986Wa22: Activity of {+35}P produced by the reaction of {+36}S(t,|a|g)
 35S 2c  with a 100 nA, 3.4 MeV triton beam. An intrinsic coaxial Ge detector   
 35S 3c  for detecting |g-rays. Measured E|g, I|g. Deduced T{-1/2} for {+35}P,  
 35S 4c  levels, log {Ift}.                                                     
 35S  c  1971Gr53: {+35}P was produced via {+37}Cl(|g,2p){+35}P reaction on     
 35S 2c  NH{-4}Cl(nat) target at Mainz electron linear accelerator. |g rays were
 35S 3c  detected using NaI(Tl) and Ge(Li) detectors. Measured E|g. Deduced     
 35S 4c  T{-1/2} of {+35}P and levels in {+35}S.                                
 35S  c  1972Ap01: {+35}P was produced via                                      

 Activity of {+35}P produced by bombardment of LiCl and NaCl  
 35S 2c  with 16 MeV tritons at the Los Alamos tandem van de Graaff. An 85      
 35S 3c  cm{+3} Ge(Li) detector for detecting |g-rays and an end-window gas-flow
 35S 4c  proportional counter for |b-rays. Measured E|g, I|g. Deduced T{-1/2}   
 35S 5c  for {+35}P, log {Ift}, J|p.                                            

 35S  c  1972Go31: {+35}P was produced via {+18}O({+19}F,2p){+35}P and          
 35S 2c  {+36}S(t,|a){+35}P at the second tandem of the Brookhaven National     
 35S 3c  Laboratory (BNL) tandem van de Graaff facility. {+35}P |b-delayed |g   
 35S 4c  rays were detected using a 60 cm{+3} Ge(Li) detector. |b particles were
 35S 5c  detected in coincidence with the 1572|g using a NE102 scintillator.    
 35S 6c  Measured E|g, I|g, and E|b. Deduced {+35}P T{-1/2}, |b end-point       
 35S 7c  energy, mass, decay branching ratios, and log {Ift}.                   
